{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜结构图\nHost选择Avatar；ASC执行事务/认证发布，唯一管能力输入等待许可；Extension唯一持本地H。\nBase仅typed Notice接线；Health唯一持DeathState与五token；Hero管原输入会话/H关联，CMC执行移动。\n[[Character/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_角色初始化.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 外部宿主：AGGYGOCombatantState\nRequestAvatarBinding(原端点,H,Context)\n→Initialize／Release／Refresh实际步骤历史。\nHost选择/公布Avatar，持ASC与基础属性集。\nDestroyed/EndPlay先关闭准入，清原资源。\n已提交Context与失败Init Operation由ASC分别认证。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主契约]] · [[Teams/结构]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` / `AbilitySets` / `AbilityGroupConfig` / `TagRelationshipMapping`\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode`：分发给对应消费者。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "character",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / HeroCharacter\nPawn持Extension／Health／CMC；玩家另持Hero。\nPostInitializeComponents Super后先装原记录，再RegisterLocalAbilitySystemNoticeAndCall。\n记录仅三weak身份/token/退休；晚token归原Extension，不存H/ASC/Set/Context/Ready。\nConsume：Ready/Refreshed→Health Init/Refresh；Released原H→Uninit；Closing合法返回，不清Health。\nEndPlay/BeginDestroy退原token，真实新BeginPlay可重开；Health独立清五token。\n[[Character/结构#Base原订阅与typed消费（已编码，未编译）|接口与资源机制]]",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "extension",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\nSetPawnData→配置；三入口请求Host。\nGetter仅原H真实Ready；唯一持本地H。\nWithdraw撤槽；EndPlay先关准入→一次Closing。\nClosing空Context，外调前消费义务；不授原生成功。\nEndPlay只Release捕获H；关闭Released不广播。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthComponent\nInitializeWithLocalAbilitySystemResource\n(Extension,H,PublishedContext,OutError)\n→验本Pawn/真实Ready/HealthSet，安装原记录。\nRefreshLocalAbilitySystemResource→同H认证新Context。\nUninitializeFromLocalAbilitySystemResource(H,OutError)\n→精确退休原记录；不RequireReady。\nDeathState唯一归Health；数值归HealthSet。\n旧BP共用机制；无H/未Ready/身份不符明确拒绝。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent（玩家）\nInitializePlayerInput→绑定/会话；H关联请求。\nClosing→原SourceASC End原ID；保留绑定/IMC/Action锁存。\n等待/重试归ASC；DetermineCameraMode→仲裁。\nSet/ClearAbilityCameraMode→原Spec所有权。\n[[Input/结构|Input]] · [[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[Camera/结构|Camera]]",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\nSetMovementSet(Data,OutError)→唯一校验并接受配置；缺失/拒绝不授执行。\nGetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot() const→只读原区间/启动暂态，消费公开scope，不凭InitState标签等待。\nHasMoveInput / GetHorizontalSpeed / IsTurnBackCurveDriven→动画语义。\n[[Movement/结构]]",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-render",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterRenderComponent\n`RefreshMaterials()`：显式槽名/材质 → MID 与原覆盖记录。\n`ReleaseMaterials()`：只释放自身覆盖与描边；同 Mesh/槽恢复原 nullable override。\n`UpdateLighting()`：显式灯/弱缓存 → 受限主光；无灯直接光为零。\n`UpdateOutline()`：显式材质 → Leader Pose 壳。\n[[Character/渲染实现|契约与限制]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Pyrios渲染.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-materials",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrios 材质资产\n`M_Pyrois_Toon`（Unlit）+ Body 1 / Body 2 / Weapon 三个 MI → 角色表面。\n`M_Pyrois_Outline` → 运行时反面扩张描边；FX01 槽位绑定 `MI_Pyrois_Body_FX`（父材质 `/Game/Characters/Shared/FX/Materials/M_FX_DissolveMaskLayers`），组件不接管该槽。\n路径：`/Game/Characters/Player/Pyrios/Materials/Generated/`。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 资源所有权与跨模块合同\nHost选择/公布Avatar；ASC唯一签Binding、执行ActorInfo事务并认证Publication，管理输入等待许可。\nExtension唯一持H及Installed/Ready；Install只装配，Ready须真实Dispatching。每H Closing义务外调前消费一次，不建第二准入状态。\nBase只持通知token：Ready/Refreshed/Released接Health，Closing合法返回；Health唯一持DeathState与原H/Context/HealthSet/五token。\nHero管原Action/native会话/H关联与镜头；Closing仅精确End原SourceASC请求，保留绑定/IMC/锁存。移动执行归CMC，能力授予归Host。\n跨Host先原Release成功→新Initialize；Closing不证明Cancel/Clear成功。关闭Released不广播，各消费者仍自行退原资源。InitState不授ASC Ready。\n[[Character/结构#ASC 本地资源四阶段接口（L1）|本地合同]] · [[Combatants/结构|Host边界]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrois 模型 / BP_PC_Pyrios\n模型三槽已保存 Toon MI，编辑器直接预览表面。\nBP 显式 MaterialSlots / OutlineMaterial 已迁移并冷回读。\n真实 PIE 已验证 MID/描边与主光响应；静态视口仍无运行描边壳。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "render-compatibility",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 序列化兼容与配置验收\n`UGGYGOPyriosRenderComponent` 继承通用类，保留旧身份。\nBP 显式槽位、描边与调参已保存重开核对；legacy=false。\n真实 PIE：3 表面 MID + Leader Pose 描边；主光限幅/关灯恢复通过。\n两项渲染自动化通过；视觉还原仍有缺口。\n[[Character/渲染实现|证据与边界]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-resource",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Extension 本地 ASC 资源（L1）\n原weak ASC/Pawn＋ASC Binding→opaque H；不签Binding。\nInstallLocalAbilitySystemResources(ASC,Pawn,Context)→Installed未Ready。\nWithdrawLocalAbilitySystemResources(H)→撤槽/未Installed→一次Closing；无native写入。\nClosing原H/空Context；EndPlay先关准入再发，义务外调前消费。\nNotifyLocalResourcesReleased(H)→原H一次通知；关闭Failed/LifecycleClosed，不广播。\nNotifyLocalResourcesReady(H,Receipt)→真实Dispatching认证Ready/Refresh。\nGetCurrentLocalAbilitySystemResource→槽快照，不授权。\nIsLocalAbilitySystemResourceInstalled/Ready(H)→装配/可用查询。\nRegisterLocalAbilitySystemNoticeAndCall / Unregister…(Handle)→精确订阅/Ready回放/移除。\n旧两无参通知已退役；Closing不证明Cancel/Clear或Released成功。\n[[Character/结构#ASC 本地资源四阶段接口（L1）|完整合同]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC权威]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "host-request-port",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IGGYGOAvatarBindingHostInterface\nRequestAvatarBinding(Request)→栈上真实Result/Steps。\n原weak Host／ASC／Pawn／Extension＋Context／opaque H；Initialize空H，Release/Refresh原H与记录Context。\nASC组件GetOwner固定端口，不猜可变ActorInfo Owner。\nH1：CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(原提交Context)认证原清理来源；关闭原Host/Owner显式ClearActorInfo，正常PreserveOwner。\nH2：TryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation,纯原scope)清未提交Init残留；Init仍失败，无Receipt/Notice/Ready。\n权限由ASC认证；Host只记实际Steps，无第二Ready。跨Host旧释放→新绑定，失败未绑定不回滚。\n原清理资格不等于新工作准入；步骤历史不授后继清理权。\n[[Character/结构#Host原生请求接口（已定义，生产迁移中）|接口定义]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|清理契约]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-original-resource-record",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Health唯一原资源记录\nFAbilitySystemResource：原Health/Pawn/Extension弱身份、H、ASC/HealthSet弱引用、认证Context、五token、退休标记。\n五lambda只捕原记录；每事件入口复制当时Context。同H Refresh更新认证Context，不重绑或重放UI初值。\nRetireOriginalResource→先退休/摘自身原槽，再向原Set五token精确Remove；失效Set不替换。\n入口/作用前/仍有后续操作的UI／Tag／GameplayEvent／GE返栈复核原记录/H/Set/Context；删去六处无后续作用的末尾复核。旧安装失败不清同H合法后继。\nBase Closing合法返回，不提前清Health；Health EndPlay/OnUnregister独立清理，不等Released。DeathState归Health，数值归HealthSet，不签Binding/Ready。\n晚装配只投影既有DeathState的Tag，不重播死亡事件；解绑不清死亡Tag，不隐式复活。\n[[Character/结构#Health原资源与五委托（已编码，未编译）|接口与关键实现]]",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "character-pawn-data-initialization-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PawnExtension｜原同步初始化 scope\nIsPawnDataInitializationInProgress() const\n输入：游戏线程、原CheckDefaultInitialization／ApplyPawnDataToConsumers同步调用。\n输出：原调用仍在栈上的bool；无scope、登记/身份/生命周期失效为false。\nFPawnDataInitializationScope只持原Extension/Pawn/World弱身份和父scope；组件借用当前栈记录。\n嵌套正常退出恢复原父scope，最外层退出关闭；OnUnregister清指针，EndPlay先关准入/清指针。旧析构不恢复失效scope或覆盖后继。\n真实后续BeginPlay仅重开准入，新调用才有scope。\nCMC只读此公开事实；accepted Set唯一归CMC，scope不代表接受/ASC Ready/长期标签等待，不建timer或执行器。\n[[Character/结构#原 PawnData 同步初始化调用|完整接口]] · [[计划_角色与组件#同步初始化 scope 与冷启动边界|机制理由]]",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
